      "type": "\u2200 (W : \u211d),\n  \u2200 j < 3,\n    \u2211 i, W * CurrentMM.grGWeight i * CurrentMM.grGNode i ^ j = \u2211 i, W * CurrentMM.grRWeight i * CurrentMM.grRNode i ^ j"
