      "name": "CurrentMM.p1_gr_third_moment_gap",
      "type": "\u2200 (W : \u211d),\n  \u2211 i, W * CurrentMM.grGWeight i * CurrentMM.grGNode i ^ 3 - \u2211 i, W * CurrentMM.grRWeight i * CurrentMM.grRNode i ^ 3 =\n    2 * W / 9"
