      "kind": "named_theorem",
      "name": "CurrentMM.p1_gr_reset_lower_bound",
      "type": "\u2200 (a \u03ba c d W H : \u211d) (N T : \u2115) (q rate q' rate' : Fin 2 \u2192 \u211d) (variance : NNReal),\n  variance \u2260 0 \u2192\n    0 \u2264 c \u2192\n      0 \u2264 d \u2192\n        c + d \u2264 1 \u2192\n          0 < W \u2192\n            0 \u2264 H \u2192\n              (\u2200 (i : Fin 2), 1 - rate i = c + d * CurrentMM.grGNode i) \u2192\n                (\u2200 (i : Fin 2), 1 - rate' i = c + d * CurrentMM.grRNode i) \u2192\n                  (\u2200 (i : Fin 2), q i * rate i = W * CurrentMM.grGWeight i) \u2192\n                    (\u2200 (i : Fin 2), q' i * rate' i = W * CurrentMM.grRWeight i) \u2192\n                      (\u2200 t < T, |CurrentMM.actualCohortImpulse a \u03ba q' rate' t| \u2264 H) \u2192\n                        \u2200 (A : Set (CurrentMM.ObservationRecord (N * T))),\n                          MeasurableSet A \u2192\n                            (CurrentMM.gaussianRecordLaw (N * T)\n                                      (CurrentMM.p1RepeatedMean N T (CurrentMM.actualCohortImpulse a \u03ba q rate))\n                                      variance).real\n                                  A \u2264\n                                1 / 4 \u2192\n                              (CurrentMM.gaussianRecordLaw (N * T)\n                                        (CurrentMM.p1RepeatedMean N T (CurrentMM.actualCohortImpulse a \u03ba q' rate'))\n                                        variance).real\n                                    A\u1d9c \u2264\n                                  1 / 4 \u2192\n                                \u2191variance \u2264 2 * \u2191N * \u2191T * (2 * W * 2 ^ T * d ^ 3 * CurrentMM.p1GapConst a |\u03ba| W H T) ^ 2"
    },
    {
      "axioms": [
        "propext",
        "Classical.choice",
        "Quot.sound"
      ],
      "kind": "named_theorem",
      "name": "CurrentMM.p1_response_robust_threshold",
      "type": "\u2200 (rA rB movedA movedB threshold radius : \u211d),\n  rA + radius \u2264 threshold \u2192\n    threshold < rB - radius \u2192 |movedA - rA| \u2264 radius \u2192 |movedB - rB| \u2264 radius \u2192 movedA \u2264 threshold \u2227 threshold < movedB"
    },
    {
      "axioms": [
        "propext",
        "Classical.choice",
        "Quot.sound"
      ],
      "kind": "named_theorem",
      "name": "CurrentMM.p1_supervisory_gaussian_unsafe_halt",
      "type": "\u2200 (N : \u2115),\n  0 < N \u2192\n    \u2200 (r threshold allowance drift radius : \u211d) (v : NNReal),\n      0 < radius \u2192\n        drift \u2264 allowance \u2192\n          (MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => ProbabilityTheory.gaussianReal r v)\n              {x | (\u2211 i, x i) / \u2191N + radius + allowance \u2264 threshold \u2227 threshold < r + drift} \u2264\n            ENNReal.ofReal (\u2191v / (\u2191N * radius ^ 2))"
    },
    {
      "axioms": [
        "propext",
        "Classical.choice",
        "Quot.sound"
      ],
      "kind": "named_theorem",
      "name": "CurrentMM.p1_supervisory_gaussian_unsafe_halt_budget",
      "type": "\u2200 (N : \u2115),\n  0 < N \u2192\n    \u2200 (r threshold allowance drift radius beta : \u211d) (v : NNReal),\n      0 < radius \u2192\n        drift \u2264 allowance \u2192\n          \u2191v \u2264 beta * (\u2191N * radius ^ 2) \u2192\n            (MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => ProbabilityTheory.gaussianReal r v)\n                {x | (\u2211 i, x i) / \u2191N + radius + allowance \u2264 threshold \u2227 threshold < r + drift} \u2264\n              ENNReal.ofReal beta"
    },
    {
      "axioms": [
